[Desktop Entry]
# @decision DEC-PHASE12-006
# @title One branded "Orion" application-menu group collects every Orion-X
#   tool
# @status accepted
# @date 2026-09-14
# @rationale v2.2.0-beta: every Orion tool carries Categories=X-Orion; and
#   applications-merged/orionx.menu collects them under this single submenu,
#   so the operator finds the deck's tools in one place instead of scattered
#   across the stock XFCE categories. test_cockpit_and_menu.sh asserts the
#   group and its members.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Orion-X Phoenix Edition — application-menu group (DEC-PHASE12-006).
# Every Orion tool carries Categories=X-Orion; and applications-merged/orionx.menu
# collects them under this single branded "Orion" submenu.
Type=Directory
Name=Orion
Comment=Orion-X Phoenix Edition — cyberdeck tools
Icon=/usr/share/pixmaps/orionx.png
